ield:\n\n  expand\\(T\\)\n    B has base type => expand\\(B\\)\n      A has no base type\n      prepend fields of A to B'\n      B' = { a1, a2, b1 }\n    prepend fields of B \\(not B'!\\)\n    T' = { b1, a1, a2, b1 }\n\nThis simplifies the code by always duplication the top-level type and then appending\nmembers of derived types.\n\nSigned-off-by: Erik Boasson <eb@ilities.com>\")\n\nShow description for 3eb6575 \n\n[ ](/eboasson) [ eboasson ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/commits?author=eboasson)\n\ncommitted  on May 12, 2025 \n\n[ 3eb6575  ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/commit/3eb6575da547777080d60c767070b26bb4aedd86) View commit details \n\nCopy full SHA for 3eb6575 \n\n[ ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/blob/3eb6575da547777080d60c767070b26bb4aedd86/src/core/ddsi/src/ddsi_typewrap.c) View code at this point  [ ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/tree/3eb6575da547777080d60c767070b26bb4aedd86) Browse repository at this point \n\nMore actions \n\n\n\n\n<::before>\n\n###  Commits on Feb 18, 2025 \n\n  * ####  [ Fix segv on null param_seq in member annotations ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/commit/d008b5bc5e8ad569e05212a554666ae67b942236 \"Fix segv on null param_seq in member annotations\n\nThe parameter sequence for a custom annotation is an optional field, and so may be a null\npointer.\n\nSigned-off-by: Erik Boasson <eb@ilities.com>\")\n\nShow description for d008b5b \n\n[ ](/eboasson) [ eboasson ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/commits?author=eboasson)\n\ncommitted  on Feb 18, 2025 \n\n[ d008b5b  ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/commit/d008b5bc5e8ad569e05212a554666ae67b942236) View commit details \n\nCopy full SHA for d008b5b \n\n[ ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/blob/d008b5bc5e8ad569e05212a554666ae67b942236/src/core/ddsi/src/ddsi_typewrap.c) View code at this point  [ ](/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/tree/d008b5bc5e8ad569e05212a554666ae67b942236) Browse repository at this point \n\nMore actions \n\n\n\n\n<::before>\n\n###  Commits on Jan 16, 2025 \n\n  * ####  